<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 321-7 V SRI LANKA (330) - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 321-7 V SRI LANKA (330) - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 321 for seven at</p>
<p>tea on the third day of the first test against Sri Lanka on</p>
<p>Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 330; Pakistan 321-7.</p>
</text>
